Please be prepared for our PI review at the end of January. Schedule is attached but can also be found here: \\us-ct-eb01\EBDepts\Eng.440\Projects-VA\VA SSW\Project Management\IMS\Agile_Planning

Filename: _PI Review Schedule.mpp_

 

{color:#FF0000}“Can you point me to the content guidance for who is expected to do what re: lines 5 – 8 in this IMS.”{color}

 

It is the same content that has been getting produced for the last year+ and the same developers. Art also just established the guidance to follow the July template. Teams have individually signed up to deep dives so they should know what and when that content needs to be created. 

 

{color:#FF0000}“I cannot say if I can meet 1/5/26 on slides if it’s not communicated what content is needed; schedule is clear even if it’s unknown if it is attainable.”{color}

